Qed.
Check LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_initializes.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_TYPE LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_readonly_initial".
