Qed.
Check LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_readonly_initial.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_TYPE LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_unchanged".
  exact I.
Qed.
Check LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_unchanged.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_TYPE LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_region.scalar_lambda_mixed_input".
  exact I.
Qed.
Check LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_region.scalar_lambda_mixed_input.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_TYPE LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_region.scalar_lambda_mixed_rhs".
