Qed.
Print LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.canonical_lambda_value.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_DEF LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_block".
