Qed.
Print LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_block.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_DEF LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_rep".
  exact I.
Qed.
Print LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_global.scalar_lambda_global_rep.
Goal True.
  idtac "LAMBDA_GLOBAL_DEF LambdaC.jet_secp_scalar_lambda_region.scalar_lambda_mixed_rho".
